OL,3,GNEWSATraders back at market after town
OL,4,Ahall restoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhitby's Market Place has a "new lease
OL,7,Fof life" after #1.3m restoration work
OL,8,Fto the Old Town Hall was completed,
OL,9,Ftraders have said.
OL,11,FWork was carried out on the 18th
OL,12,FCentury landmark due to deterioration
OL,13,Fcaused by age and the weather, North
OL,14,FYorkshire Council (NYC) said.
OL,16,FConstruction at the Grade II listed
OL,17,Fbuilding began in 2025, with the market
OL,18,Ftemporarily relocated to Dock End, but
OL,19,Fit returned to its original home on
OL,20,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
