OL,3,GNEWSATraders back at market after town
OL,4,Ahall restoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtist Gary Jamieson, who has been the
OL,7,Fresident caricaturist at the market for
OL,8,F16 years, said: "I'm thrilled to be
OL,9,Fback sketching under these iconic
OL,10,Farches and welcoming locals and
OL,11,Fvisitors back to our creative hub."
